            "value": "Standard unstructured LLM chatbots fail in accounting because enterprise ledgers permit zero numeric tolerance. Elesium solves this challenge by pairing multimodal vision agents for layout-aware invoice OCR with reliable Pydantic validation schemas, state machine guardrails, and native XML-over-HTTP socket integration directly into Tally Prime's port 9000."
