            "type": "paragraph",
            "value": "| Litigation Workflow | Manual Associate Preparation | Elesium private Legal AI Automation |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Special Leave Petition (SLP) Drafting** | 24 \u2013 40 billable associate hours | 3.5 hours (88% reduction with human oversight) |\n| **50,000-page Evidence Discovery** | 2 to 3 weeks of junior advocate review | 45 minutes automated forensic vector clustering |\n| **Section 63 BSA Certificate Compliance** | Prone to evidentiary defect notices | 100% cryptographic SHA-256 compliance guarantee |\n| **Precedent Cross-Checking** | Manual SCC / Manupatra search queries | Automated CNR verification across 3,500+ Indian courts |\n| **Client Privilege & DPDP Compliance** | High risk of public cloud prompt leakage | 100% Air-Gapped Private VPC Deployment (Zero data egress) |\n| **Case Docket Status Synchronization** | Manual daily e-Courts scraping | Automated e-Courts Phase III webhook synchronization |"
