                "type": "paragraph",
                "value": "### 4.2 Hyperparameter Tuning for Clinical Corpora\nTo prevent major forgetting of general reasoning capabilities while instilling domain expertise, we utilize the following hyperparameter profile:\n* **Learning Rate:** $1.5 \\times 10^{-5}$ with cosine schedule and 3% warm-up steps.\n* **Batch Size:** Gradient accumulation steps set to 16 to achieve an effective batch size of 128.\n* **Context Window:** 8,192 tokens to accommodate multi-page patient discharge summaries and clinical history."
