                "value": "### Component Breakdown\n1. **Ingress Proxy & TLS Termination:** Terminates incoming REST and gRPC requests from internal microservices, enforcing mutual TLS (mTLS) and OAuth2/JWT token validation within dedicated subnets.\n2. **VPC-Isolated LangGraph Engine:** Manages reliable execution graphs, maintaining state across multi-turn interactions without leaking PII to external vendors.\n3. **Local LLM Inference Cluster:** Deploys quantized open-weights models (e.g., Llama-3-70B-Instruct, Mistral-Large) via vLLM or Text Generation Inference (TGI) on dedicated GPU nodes (NVIDIA A100/H100 PCIe).\n4. **Vector Knowledge Store:** Hosted locally via Milvus or pgvector within the same VPC subnet, ensuring zero cross-region data egress and sub-15ms vector retrieval times. For organizations evaluating implementation partners, consulting with an [enterprise AI automation agency in India](/ai-automation-agency-india) ensures reliable guardrails. Related operational research: [Top AI Automation Agencies in India](/signals/top-ai-automation-agencies-india-2026)."
