                "type": "paragraph",
                "value": "**Enterprise implementations of reliable LangGraph multi-agent systems across Bangalore BFSI and manufacturing cut reconciliation latency from 14.5 hours to 1.8 seconds. Operating within private VPC environments with zero model retention, these architectures deliver verified 3.5x cash-flow returns within 90 days under Indian DPDP Act compliance.**"
